1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:01,301
Hi friends!

2
00:00:01,301 --> 00:00:03,304
Let's play a letter game!

3
00:00:03,854 --> 00:00:05,497
One letter is hiding.

4
00:00:05,497 --> 00:00:06,798
Can you find it?

5
00:00:08,148 --> 00:00:09,981
A, B, what?

6
00:00:10,381 --> 00:00:12,524
Which letter is missing?

7
00:00:15,824 --> 00:00:17,094
It's C!

8
00:00:17,644 --> 00:00:19,055
A, B, C!

9
00:00:19,605 --> 00:00:21,272
Well done!

10
00:00:22,622 --> 00:00:24,527
D, E, what?

11
00:00:24,927 --> 00:00:27,069
Which letter is missing?

12
00:00:30,369 --> 00:00:31,539
It's F!

13
00:00:32,089 --> 00:00:33,379
D, E, F!

14
00:00:33,929 --> 00:00:35,596
Well done!

15
00:00:36,946 --> 00:00:38,803
what, H, I?

16
00:00:39,203 --> 00:00:41,346
Which letter is missing?

17
00:00:44,646 --> 00:00:45,936
It's G!

18
00:00:46,486 --> 00:00:47,756
G, H, I!

19
00:00:50,406 --> 00:00:52,216
J, what, L?

20
00:00:52,616 --> 00:00:54,758
Which letter is missing?

21
00:00:58,058 --> 00:00:59,268
It's K!

22
00:00:59,818 --> 00:01:01,209
J, K, L!

23
00:01:01,759 --> 00:01:03,426
Well done!

24
00:01:04,776 --> 00:01:06,657
M, N, what?

25
00:01:07,057 --> 00:01:09,200
Which letter is missing?

26
00:01:12,500 --> 00:01:13,709
It's O!

27
00:01:14,259 --> 00:01:15,570
M, N, O!

28
00:01:16,120 --> 00:01:17,786
Well done!

29
00:01:19,136 --> 00:01:21,017
what, Q, R?

30
00:01:21,417 --> 00:01:23,560
Which letter is missing?

31
00:01:26,860 --> 00:01:28,090
It's P!

32
00:01:28,640 --> 00:01:30,051
P, Q, R!

33
00:01:32,701 --> 00:01:34,606
S, T, what?

34
00:01:35,006 --> 00:01:37,149
Which letter is missing?

35
00:01:40,449 --> 00:01:41,759
It's U!

36
00:01:42,309 --> 00:01:43,741
S, T, U!

37
00:01:44,291 --> 00:01:45,957
Well done!

38
00:01:47,307 --> 00:01:49,212
V, what, X?

39
00:01:49,612 --> 00:01:51,755
Which letter is missing?

40
00:01:55,055 --> 00:01:56,708
It's W!

41
00:01:57,258 --> 00:01:59,133
V, W, X!

42
00:01:59,683 --> 00:02:01,350
Well done!

43
00:02:02,700 --> 00:02:04,581
X, Y, what?

44
00:02:04,981 --> 00:02:07,124
Which letter is missing?

45
00:02:10,423 --> 00:02:11,774
It's Z!

46
00:02:12,324 --> 00:02:13,937
X, Y, Z!

47
00:02:16,587 --> 00:02:19,430
You found every missing letter!

48
00:02:19,980 --> 00:02:22,218
Great job, little learner!

49
00:02:22,768 --> 00:02:24,656
Share Mimzi with a friend,

50
00:02:24,656 --> 00:02:27,196
and subscribe for more learning fun!

51
00:02:27,746 --> 00:02:28,720
Next time,

52
00:02:28,720 --> 00:02:31,416
let's read my picture dictionary.

53
00:02:31,666 --> 00:02:33,037
Bye bye!
